cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Third Reading — independent specification reading of LLRLANG 0.3.2"
message: If you use this reading or the llri_grok oracle, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "xAI Grok"
    affiliation: xAI
date-released: "2026-09-15"
version: "0.3.2-reading-3"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Third independent model reading of the LLRLANG 0.3.2 language reference.
  Contains a tree-walking interpreter written from the specification alone,
  115 test programs, captured run evidence (FINAL PASS), and a list of
  remaining contradictions and gaps after the 0.3.2 spec-tightening release.
keywords:
  - LLRLANG
  - compilers
  - specification
  - independent implementation
  - bootstrap
